cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this corpus or its pipeline, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Somali NLP Corpus"
abstract: >-
  A cleaned, deduplicated Somali text corpus for NLP and language-model research: 7,913,008
  documents, 826,973,689 words and 1,129,084,663 tokens from 14 public sources, with
  per-record licenses, and the Rust pipeline that builds it. The corpus has no single
  license: each record keeps the license of its upstream dataset (see ATTRIBUTION.md in the
  dataset).
authors:
  - name: "SOMAST"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-19
url: "https://huggingface.co/datasets/somast/somali-nlp-corpus"
repository-code: "https://github.com/somastllc/somali-nlp-corpus"
keywords:
  - somali
  - low-resource languages
  - natural language processing
  - text corpus
  - pretraining
contact:
  - name: "SOMAST"
    email: "info@somast.so"
